OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire students celebrate GCSE
OL,4,Asuccess
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of Yorkshire students have
OL,7,Fpicked up their GCSE results, with many
OL,8,Fthanking their teachers for their
OL,9,Fexcellent grades.
OL,11,FIn Yorkshire and the Humber, 19% of
OL,12,FGCSE entries were awarded the top
OL,13,Fgrades of 7 or higher - an improvement
OL,14,Ffrom 18.4% in 2025 and 17.8% in the
OL,15,Fpre-pandemic year of 2019.
OL,17,FThe pass rate in the region - entries
OL,18,Fawarded a 4 or higher - was 64.2%. In
OL,19,F2025, the pass rate was 63.6% and in
OL,20,F2019, it was 64.1%.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
